title: Walk Away Lock Sync Menu Toggle Enable
raw_community_title: ⚡ [Lightning] Walk Away Lock Sync Menu Toggle Enable
category: Locks and Security
platform: F-150 Lightning
model_years: 2022-2023
trim: All
source_sheet: 2021-2026 F150.xlsx
notes: '[Category: Locks and Security] [Years: 2022-2023] [Original Title: Walk-away
  Lock (WAL)]

  Enables toggles on Sync screen for WAL and WAL Feedback (horn honk). Standard on
  2024+. Actual functionality requires updated BCM software from dealer or OTA.'
steps:
- module: APIM
  address: 7D0-09-05
  targets:
  - mask: xxxx *xxx xx--
    community_hex: C
    type: discrete
    bits:
    - bit: 3
      action: 1
      feature: Walk Away Lock (WAL)
    - bit: 2
      action: 1
      feature: Walk Away Lock Feedback (WALF)
recipe_version: '1.1'
